        "title": "Fix max tokens for lite mode",
        "summary": "Adjusts default max_tokens in promptClaudeStreamWithoutRetry. Sonnet uses 40k, others 8096. Affects backend/src/claude.ts.",
        "significance": "minor",
        "at": "2026-09-15T16:45:55.285Z"
      },
      "eli5": {
        "text": "When you use the service in lite mode without a specific token limit set, the system now picks a smarter default: it allows a longer response for our premium model (40k tokens) and a shorter one for the standard version (8k tokens). This means lighter requests will no longer time out or get cut off as quickly when using the better model. The change is live today.",
